  <RimWorldAccess.TransportPods.Selection.NotAdjacent>此运输舱的发射器未与该组相邻。</RimWorldAccess.TransportPods.Selection.NotAdjacent>
  <RimWorldAccess.TransportPods.Selection.AlreadyLoading>运输舱已在装载或准备发射</RimWorldAccess.TransportPods.Selection.AlreadyLoading>
