  <RimWorldAccess.TransportPods.Selection.PodsUnavailable>所选运输舱已不可用</RimWorldAccess.TransportPods.Selection.PodsUnavailable>
  <RimWorldAccess.TransportPods.Selection.LoadCommandMissingMayBeLoading>找不到装载命令。运输舱可能已在装载。</RimWorldAccess.TransportPods.Selection.LoadCommandMissingMayBeLoading>

