  <RimWorldAccess.TransportPods.Loading.OpenAnnouncementMany>装载运输舱。{0} 个运输舱，容量 {1} 千克。左右切换选项卡，回车调整。</RimWorldAccess.TransportPods.Loading.OpenAnnouncementMany>

